::notice file=Directory.Packages.props::Directory.Packages.props sets CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled to $(A)?::error::x, which this check can't read without evaluating MSBuild, so it counts transitive pinning as on.
::warning file=Directory.Packages.props::A is pinned in Directory.Packages.props but no project references it
Reported as warnings: a reference this check can't read without evaluating MSBuild ($(X?::add-mask::y?::stop-commands::t)) may name any of the pins above.
